t/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HPqbpQkGHeyeuRxDzv4SY/558dcf1216066b32110cbaa3dedb4da9/Audience.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HPqbpQkGHeyeuRxDzv4SY/558dcf1216066b32110cbaa3dedb4da9/Audience.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1HPqbpQkGHeyeuRxDzv4SY/558dcf1216066b32110cbaa3dedb4da9/Audience.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w" imageSizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" data-next-head=""/><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","headline":"Frequently Asked Questions","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"1. What is Audience Insights?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sensor Tower Audience Insights is a solution that shows the demographics and behaviors of app audiences, including which ads they’ve seen, which other apps they use, and top competitor audiences."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"2. What can you learn about existing audiences?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can discover the makeup of your current user base, including demographic segments, ad exposure patterns, and other apps they engage with most. You can also identify new audiences for future engagement. "}},{"@type":"Question","name":"3. How does Audience Insights help with competitor analysis?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Audience Insights reveals competitors’ audience characteristics and the ads they see, helping you ensure you’re reaching the right targets."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"4. Who uses Audience Insights?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"  App marketers Game developers Media and marketing teams Brand strategists\n "}},{"@type":"Question","name":"5. Can Audience Insights help with ad targeting?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. By showing which audiences are already being targeted and which aren’t, it guides smarter ad placements and strategy by helping to identify untapped audiences and current competitor overlap."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"6. How is the data collected?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sensor Tower uses proprietary modeling, panel-based methodologies, first-party global app engagement, and social ad data to provide audience behavior estimates. "}},{"@type":"Question","name":"7. How does Audience Insights fit into Sensor Tower’s analytics ecosystem?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"When paired with , Audience Insights provides valuable information about the target personas reached by your competitors, giving users a deeper understanding of campaign targeting and reach. "}}]}</script><style>
