</p><br/></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row mui-1pj9b3d-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiCard-root mui-beho5w-Card-root" data-testid="Card" id="UjTteZvlhuYp53t5uTbGB" style="--Paper-shadow:0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)"><div class="MuiCardMedia-root mui-b5mcph"><img title=" Identify and address competitor threats Img" alt=" Identify and address competitor threats Img" data-testid="Card-media" loading="lazy" width="1170" height="861" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-1vlr4m1-Image-root-Media-root" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/5DtNCmN8wsch54g8yXrrN6/fa2e784f5f5cf0a0f3134224e20df4af/Audience_-_Identify_and_address_competitor_threats.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40"/></div><div class="MuiCardContent-root mui-15q2cw4"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Card-title"> Identify and address competitor threats</h3><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Card-body"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Learn which competitor advertisers are targeting your audiences and which apps are taking mindshare from your user bases.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">
</p><br/></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row mui-1pj9b3d-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiCard-root mui-1q9ejbr-Card-root" data-testid="Card" id="5McvAVOJx2pzqHLW2MwrZq" style="--Paper-shadow:0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)"><div class="MuiCardMedia-root mui-b5mcph"><img title="Discover and reach new audiences Img" alt="Discover and reach new audiences Img" data-testid="Card-media" loading="lazy" width="1170" height="861" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-1vlr4m1-Image-root-Media-root" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1g8m2iwZ51ECGdGcVwCejt/ba70920aaf40c1ae4c86b8301f62db53/Audience_-_Discover_and_reach_new_audiences.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40"/></div><div class="MuiCardContent-root mui-15q2cw4"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Card-title">Discover and reach new audiences</h3><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Card-body"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Find new personas to target within your desired demographics. Be informed of which advertisers target the new personas and which apps they engage with most.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">
</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">
</p><br/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="MuiBox-root mui-kpy5d0-Section-root" variant="Collection_icon-dark-three_section-wrapper"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-spacing-xs-4 mui-pv3zgd-Section-gridContainer"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-grow mui-1q1tf88-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-66hbl6-Collection-root" data-testid="Collection" id="6lxRLeulRCpkROx4Tgm0Ph"><div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl mui-1ai0sx8-Collection-contentContainer" data-testid="Collection-contentContainer"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1iedn95-Section-root" data-testid="Collection-section" variant="icon-dark-three"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-spacing-xs-5 mui-txrp2r-Section-gridContainer"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-md-4 mui-1hexbdp-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiCard-root mui-ym82uv-Card-root" data-testid="Card" id="6cybWMG5BLOHh91vUT1zdK" style="--Paper-shadow:0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)"><div class="MuiCardMedia-root mui-b5mcph"><img title="App Marketers &amp; Game Developers Icon" alt="App Marketers &amp; Game Developers Icon" data-testid="Card-media" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-1vlr4m1-Image-root-Media-root" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767.95px) 100vw, 33vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/37azllyJzwyUmZpimrYXJb/d9bdcf3166f951f3651959dcc8a45d28/App_Marketers.svg 256w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/37azllyJzwyUmZpimrYXJb/d9bdcf3166f951f3651959dcc8a45d28/App_Marketers.svg 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/37azllyJzwyUmZpimrYXJb/d9bdcf3166f951f3651959dcc8a45d28/App_Marketers.svg 640w, https://images.