" data-nimg="1" class="mui-1vlr4m1-Image-root-Media-root" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767.95px) 100vw, 33vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 256w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2enCXkUom8TCikwNjU6w6W/6361c9818f48a1ace17d734e56e4c7ba/Media_Sellers.svg"/></div><div class="MuiCardContent-root mui-15q2cw4"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Card-title">Media Sellers</h3><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Card-body"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Prospect smarter, win more pitches, grow advertiser investments and share of wallet.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-md-4 mui-1hexbdp-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiCard-root mui-ym82uv-Card-root" data-testid="Card" id="4r6yRDPcVCyBKUlgvrORUr" style="--Paper-shadow:0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)"><div class="MuiCardMedia-root mui-b5mcph"><img title="Brand Marketers Icon" alt="Brand Marketers Icon" data-testid="Card-media" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-1vlr4m1-Image-root-Media-root" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767.95px) 100vw, 33vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 256w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/4PxJLzOSESG9AiNrNb0ivC/02f4efe07fe1b268968432b614c4b704/Brand_Marketers.svg"/></div><div class="MuiCardContent-root mui-15q2cw4"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Card-title">Brand Marketers</h3><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Card-body"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Increase share of voice, spend smarter, grow revenue, and reduce waste.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="MuiBox-root mui-fpast0-Section-root" variant="Quote_default_section-wrapper"><div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl mui-1niwxtm-Section-contentContainer"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row mui-1p1g6o3-Section-gridContainer"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-grow mui-1q1tf88-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiCard-root mui-1u219q3-Card-root" data-testid="Card" id="7ajLb2srprdDqeGzx7C8Qy" style="--Paper-shadow:0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)"><div class="MuiCardContent-root mui-15q2cw4"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Card-title">Chief Executive, big 10 social media platform</h3><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Card-body"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">“Not just one top advertiser, we use this data to identify a set of advertisers that over index or under index on our app, so we can go after them with targeted efforts.”</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="MuiBox-root mui-1iedn95-Section-root" variant="Frequentlyaskedquestions_default_section-wrapper"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row mui-1p1g6o3-Section-gridContainer"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-grow mui-1q1tf88-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-e33eu6-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-root" data-testid="FrequentlyAskedQuestions"><div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl mui-2v3jho"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-vu3c8p-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="MuiBox-root mui-be79it-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionWrapper"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded mui-4z4o09-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordion" data-testid="FAQ-item-4PGfvRCet3fCXDUiELbpQG" style="--Paper-shadow:none"><h3 class="MuiAccordion-heading mui-wnfue5"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root mui-t7t9fw-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionSummary" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-4PGfvRCet3fCXDUiELbpQG-content" id="panel-4PGfvRCet3fCXDUiELbpQG-header"><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-vuxf0f"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-17igz8y-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-question">1. What is Audience Insights?</h3></span><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-980m34"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1wb9ucj" data-testid="accordion-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="16" viewBox="0 0 28 16" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_375_539)"><path d="M0.000245252 1.52593L14.0007 16.0005L15.4761 14.4751L1.47565 0.000560356L0.000245252 1.52593Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.5256 14.4751L14.001 16.0005L28.0015 1.52593L26.5261 0.000560356L12.5256 14.4751Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_375_539"><rect width="16" height="28" fill="white" transform="translate(0 16) rotate(-90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div></span></button></h3><div style="min-height:0px" class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden mui-abqyn"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical mui-15830to"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical mui-9vd5ud"><div aria-labelledby="panel-4PGfvRCet3fCXDUiELbpQG-header" id="panel-4PGfvRCet3fCXDUiELbpQG-content" role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region mui-1xdhyk6"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root mui-1cabhlz-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionDetails"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Text-root"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Sensor Tower Audience Insights is a solution that shows the demographics and behaviors of app audiences, including which ads they’ve seen, which other apps they use, and top competitor audiences.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth mui-9k49o2"/><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded mui-4z4o09-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordion" data-testid="FAQ-item-6lExfi2yazxu9AkAjBFoWs" style="--Paper-shadow:none"><h3 class="MuiAccordion-heading mui-wnfue5"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root mui-t7t9fw-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionSummary" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-6lExfi2yazxu9AkAjBFoWs-content" id="panel-6lExfi2yazxu9AkAjBFoWs-header"><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-vuxf0f"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-17igz8y-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-question">2. What can you learn about existing audiences?</h3></span><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-980m34"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1wb9ucj" data-testid="accordion-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="16" viewBox="0 0 28 16" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_375_539)"><path d="M0.000245252 1.52593L14.0007 16.0005L15.4761 14.4751L1.47565 0.000560356L0.000245252 1.52593Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.5256 14.4751L14.001 16.0005L28.0015 1.52593L26.5261 0.000560356L12.5256 14.4751Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_375_539"><rect width="16" height="28" fill="white" transform="translate(0 16) rotate(-90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div></span></button></h3><div style="min-height:0px" class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden mui-abqyn"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical mui-15830to"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical mui-9vd5ud"><div aria-labelledby="panel-6lExfi2yazxu9AkAjBFoWs-header" id="panel-6lExfi2yazxu9AkAjBFoWs-content" role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region mui-1xdhyk6"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root mui-1cabhlz-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionDetails"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Text-root"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">You can discover the makeup of your current user base, including demographic segments, ad exposure patterns, and other apps they engage with most. You can also identify new audiences for future engagement. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth mui-9k49o2"/><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded mui-4z4o09-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordion" data-testid="FAQ-item-26SHTPTlA4oOSjV8r1pcT0" style="--Paper-shadow:none"><h3 class="MuiAccordion-heading mui-wnfue5"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root mui-t7t9fw-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionSummary" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-26SHTPTlA4oOSjV8r1pcT0-content" id="panel-26SHTPTlA4oOSjV8r1pcT0-header"><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-vuxf0f"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-17igz8y-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-question">3. How does Audience Insights help with competitor analysis?</h3></span><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-980m34"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1wb9ucj" data-testid="accordion-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="16" viewBox="0 0 28 16" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_375_539)"><path d="M0.000245252 1.52593L14.0007 16.0005L15.4761 14.4751L1.47565 0.000560356L0.000245252 1.52593Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.5256 14.4751L14.001 16.0005L28.0015 1.52593L26.5261 0.000560356L12.5256 14.4751Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_375_539"><rect width="16" height="28" fill="white" transform="translate(0 16) rotate(-90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div></span></button></h3><div style="min-height:0px" class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden mui-abqyn"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical mui-15830to"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical mui-9vd5ud"><div aria-labelledby="panel-26SHTPTlA4oOSjV8r1pcT0-header" id="panel-26SHTPTlA4oOSjV8r1pcT0-content" role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region mui-1xdhyk6"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root mui-1cabhlz-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionDetails"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Text-root"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Audience Insights reveals competitors’ audience characteristics and the ads they see, helping you ensure you’re reaching the right targets.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth mui-9k49o2"/><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded mui-4z4o09-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordion" data-testid="FAQ-item-7uX8iWkpnZaUsOWIZnut1B" style="--Paper-shadow:none"><h3 class="MuiAccordion-heading mui-wnfue5"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root mui-t7t9fw-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionSummary" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-7uX8iWkpnZaUsOWIZnut1B-content" id="panel-7uX8iWkpnZaUsOWIZnut1B-header"><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-vuxf0f"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-17igz8y-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-question">4. Who uses Audience Insights?</h3></span><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-980m34"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1wb9ucj" data-testid="accordion-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="16" viewBox="0 0 28 16" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_375_539)"><path d="M0.000245252 1.52593L14.0007 16.0005L15.4761 14.4751L1.47565 0.000560356L0.000245252 1.52593Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.5256 14.4751L14.001 16.0005L28.0015 1.52593L26.5261 0.000560356L12.5256 14.4751Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_375_539"><rect width="16" height="28" fill="white" transform="translate(0 16) rotate(-90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div></span></button></h3><div style="min-height:0px" class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden mui-abqyn"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical mui-15830to"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical mui-9vd5ud"><div aria-labelledby="panel-7uX8iWkpnZaUsOWIZnut1B-header" id="panel-7uX8iWkpnZaUsOWIZnut1B-content" role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region mui-1xdhyk6"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root mui-1cabhlz-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionDetails"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Text-root"><ul><li><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">App marketers</p></li><li><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Game developers</p></li><li><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Media and marketing teams</p></li><li><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Brand strategists
</p></li></ul><br/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth mui-9k49o2"/><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded mui-4z4o09-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordion" data-testid="FAQ-item-6neGCYThVCgrZvq15oWo1U" style="--Paper-shadow:none"><h3 class="MuiAccordion-heading mui-wnfue5"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root mui-t7t9fw-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionSummary" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-6neGCYThVCgrZvq15oWo1U-content" id="panel-6neGCYThVCgrZvq15oWo1U-header"><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-vuxf0f"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-17igz8y-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-question">5. Can Audience Insights help with ad targeting?</h3></span><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-980m34"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1wb9ucj" data-testid="accordion-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="16" viewBox="0 0 28 16" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_375_539)"><path d="M0.000245252 1.52593L14.0007 16.0005L15.4761 14.4751L1.47565 0.000560356L0.000245252 1.52593Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.5256 14.4751L14.001 16.0005L28.0015 1.52593L26.5261 0.000560356L12.5256 14.4751Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_375_539"><rect width="16" height="28" fill="white" transform="translate(0 16) rotate(-90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div></span></button></h3><div style="min-height:0px" class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden mui-abqyn"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical mui-15830to"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical mui-9vd5ud"><div aria-labelledby="panel-6neGCYThVCgrZvq15oWo1U-header" id="panel-6neGCYThVCgrZvq15oWo1U-content" role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region mui-1xdhyk6"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root mui-1cabhlz-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionDetails"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Text-root"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Yes. By showing which audiences are already being targeted and which aren’t, it guides smarter ad placements and strategy by helping to identify untapped audiences and current competitor overlap.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth mui-9k49o2"/><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded mui-4z4o09-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordion" data-testid="FAQ-item-3fzKXymC5ylPKlUihqXSFH" style="--Paper-shadow:none"><h3 class="MuiAccordion-heading mui-wnfue5"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root mui-t7t9fw-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionSummary" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-3fzKXymC5ylPKlUihqXSFH-content" id="panel-3fzKXymC5ylPKlUihqXSFH-header"><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-vuxf0f"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-17igz8y-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-question">6. How is the data collected?</h3></span><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-980m34"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1wb9ucj" data-testid="accordion-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="16" viewBox="0 0 28 16" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_375_539)"><path d="M0.000245252 1.52593L14.0007 16.0005L15.4761 14.4751L1.47565 0.000560356L0.000245252 1.52593Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.5256 14.4751L14.001 16.0005L28.0015 1.52593L26.5261 0.000560356L12.5256 14.4751Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_375_539"><rect width="16" height="28" fill="white" transform="translate(0 16) rotate(-90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div></span></button></h3><div style="min-height:0px" class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden mui-abqyn"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical mui-15830to"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical mui-9vd5ud"><div aria-labelledby="panel-3fzKXymC5ylPKlUihqXSFH-header" id="panel-3fzKXymC5ylPKlUihqXSFH-content" role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region mui-1xdhyk6"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root mui-1cabhlz-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionDetails"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Text-root"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Sensor Tower uses proprietary modeling, panel-based methodologies, <b>first-party global app engagement, and social ad data</b> to provide audience behavior estimates. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth mui-9k49o2"/><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded mui-4z4o09-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordion" data-testid="FAQ-item-2I1un7vqsc1b3HkMOHPI5g" style="--Paper-shadow:none"><h3 class="MuiAccordion-heading mui-wnfue5"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root mui-t7t9fw-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionSummary" tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-2I1un7vqsc1b3HkMOHPI5g-content" id="panel-2I1un7vqsc1b3HkMOHPI5g-header"><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-vuxf0f"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-17igz8y-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-question">7. How does Audience Insights fit into Sensor Tower’s analytics ecosystem?</h3></span><span class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-980m34"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1wb9ucj" data-testid="accordion-icon-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="16" viewBox="0 0 28 16" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_375_539)"><path d="M0.000245252 1.52593L14.0007 16.0005L15.4761 14.4751L1.47565 0.000560356L0.000245252 1.52593Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.5256 14.4751L14.001 16.0005L28.0015 1.52593L26.5261 0.000560356L12.5256 14.4751Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_375_539"><rect width="16" height="28" fill="white" transform="translate(0 16) rotate(-90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div></span></button></h3><div style="min-height:0px" class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden mui-abqyn"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical mui-15830to"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical mui-9vd5ud"><div aria-labelledby="panel-2I1un7vqsc1b3HkMOHPI5g-header" id="panel-2I1un7vqsc1b3HkMOHPI5g-content" role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region mui-1xdhyk6"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root mui-1cabhlz-FrequentlyAskedQuestions-accordionDetails"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Text-root"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">When paired with <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://sensortower.com/product/digital-advertising/pathmatics" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink">Pathmatics Digital Advertising Insights</a>, Audience Insights provides valuable information about the target personas reached by your competitors, giving users a deeper understanding of campaign targeting and reach. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth mui-9k49o2"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="MuiBox-root mui-1g7w3jf-Section-root" variant="Collection_three-per-row_section-wrapper"><div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl mui-1niwxtm-Section-contentContainer"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-spacing-xs-4 mui-pv3zgd-Section-gridContainer"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-grow mui-1q1tf88-Sectio