534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40"/></div><div class="MuiCardContent-root mui-15q2cw4"><div class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 mui-1jwk0jl-Card-subtitle" data-testid="Card-subtitle">Digital Advertising Insights • September 2026</div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Card-body"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Text-h3">State of Digital Advertising 2026: How AI Integration and Streaming Growth Reframe Marketing Strategies</h3><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">US digital ad spend hit $200 billion between August 2025 and July 2026 as brands increasingly leveraged generative AI, ChatGPT advertising, and OTT streaming to drive performance.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-md-4 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 mui-fccosw-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiCard-root has-link mui-m5i5ng-Card-root" data-testid="Card" id="6iJmtr56CoPYZPlZ5w2J4l" style="--Paper-shadow:0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)"><a class="mui-a5upom-Card-cardLink" __typename="Link" aria-label="AI Insights" href="/webinar/ai-economy-by-the-numbers-market-share-monetization-and-what-comes-next"></a><div class="MuiCardMedia-root mui-b5mcph"><img title="State of AI Webinar Resource Card Img" alt="State of AI Webinar Resource Card Img" data-testid="Card-media" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1110" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-1vlr4m1-Image-root-Media-root" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 683.95px) 100vw, (max-width: 767.95px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=256&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 256w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40"/></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1y8t0pw-Card-tags"><div class="MuiChip-root MuiChip-filled MuiChip-sizeMedium MuiChip-colorDefault mui-108fcjd"><span class="MuiChip-label mui-14vsv3w">Webinar</span></div></div><div class="MuiCardContent-root mui-15q2cw4"><div class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 mui-1jwk0jl-Card-subtitle" data-testid="Card-subtitle">AI Insights</div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Card-body"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Text-h3">Watch the On-Demand Webinar</h3><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Discover the trends shaping the AI economy, from the competitive LLM landscape and market share to emerging organic and paid marketing patterns. Learn how AI is influencing product discovery, shopping behavior, and purchase decisions and how ChatGPT Ads compare with other advertising channels.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-md-4 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 mui-fccosw-Section-gridItem"><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiCard-root has-link mui-m5i5ng-Card-root" data-testid="Card" id="yJAx7sUjUzc8ESl3gTUhQ" style="--Paper-shadow:0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)"><a class="mui-a5upom-Card-cardLink" __typename="Link" aria-label="Digital Advertising Insights • August 2026" href="/blog/the-art-of-the-steal-gtavi-is-coming-video-game-insights-sales-tracker"></a><div class="MuiCardMedia-root mui-b5mcph"><img title="GTA BLOG Hero Image" alt="GTA BLOG Hero Image" data-testid="Card-media" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1110" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-1vlr4m1-Image-root-Media-root" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 683.95px) 100vw, (max-width: 767.95px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=256&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 256w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40"/></div><div class="MuiCardContent-root mui-15q2cw4"><div class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 mui-1jwk0jl-Card-subtitle" data-testid="Card-subtitle">Digital Advertising Insights • August 2026</div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Card-body"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Text-h3">The Art of The Steal: GTA VI is Coming, And This is The Game Tracker You Need to Prepare</h3><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Since its release in 1997, Grand Theft Auto has become one of the most successful game franchises in history, selling more than 450M copies worldwide, putting it in rare-air with Pokémon, Mario, and Call of Duty. With Rockstar Games’ latest installment GTA VI set to release in November, our live game tracker gives you all the updated data you need across PlayStation, Xbox, and Steam.
</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1kym5wk-Footer-root" data-testid="Footer"><div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl mui-ki8slo-Footer-container"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1ofqig9"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1f5e1yp"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-i3jcei"></div><div class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth MuiDivider-vertical MuiDivider-flexItem mui-1d9f5xc" role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical"></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-ieri5n"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-spacing-xs-1 mui-nmsqrm"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row mui-mee2nq"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fq3yn" data-testid="Footer-navigationItem"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-1ivbx4h" id="3Q9HQ4aXb2aVpEYUovqxQq" href="/about">About</a></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fq3yn" data-testid="Footer-navigationItem"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-1ivbx4h" id="5bZyjxLERsLu340lPJiqqR" href="/careers">Careers</a></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fq3yn" data-testid="Footer-navigationItem"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-1ivbx4h" href="https://help.sensortower.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" id="4BTUiKo2SFHnFJvRcj0rwZ">Support</a></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fq3yn" data-testid="Footer-navigationItem"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-1ivbx4h" href="https://uptime.com/s/sensortower" target="_blank" rel="noopener" id="2ftM1PBJnDlDqPwfwjPYKD">Status</a></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fq3yn" data-testid="Footer-navigationItem"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-1ivbx4h" id="4FP52ysr9939nI1zFahkTZ" href="/tos">Terms of Service</a></div><di