ution that shows the demographics and behaviors of app audiences, including which ads they’ve seen, which other apps they use, and top competitor audiences.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"}}},{"id":"6lExfi2yazxu9AkAjBFoWs","__typename":"QuestionItem","question":"2. What can you learn about existing audiences?","answer":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"You can discover the makeup of your current user base, including demographic segments, ad exposure patterns, and other apps they engage with most. You can also identify new audiences for future engagement. ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"}}},{"id":"26SHTPTlA4oOSjV8r1pcT0","__typename":"QuestionItem","question":"3. How does Audience Insights help with competitor analysis?","answer":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Audience Insights reveals competitors’ audience characteristics and the ads they see, helping you ensure you’re reaching the right targets.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"}}},{"id":"7uX8iWkpnZaUsOWIZnut1B","__typename":"QuestionItem","question":"4. Who uses Audience Insights?","answer":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"App marketers","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"list-item"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Game developers","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"list-item"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Media and marketing teams","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"list-item"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Brand strategists\n","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"list-item"}],"nodeType":"unordered-list"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"}}},{"id":"6neGCYThVCgrZvq15oWo1U","__typename":"QuestionItem","question":"5. Can Audience Insights help with ad targeting?","answer":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Yes. By showing which audiences are already being targeted and which aren’t, it guides smarter ad placements and strategy by helping to identify untapped audiences and current competitor overlap.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"}}},{"id":"3fzKXymC5ylPKlUihqXSFH","__typename":"QuestionItem","question":"6. How is the data collected?","answer":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Sensor Tower uses proprietary modeling, panel-based methodologies, ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"value":"first-party global app engagement, and social ad data","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":" to provide audience behavior estimates. ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"}}},{"id":"2I1un7vqsc1b3HkMOHPI5g","__typename":"QuestionItem","question":"7. How does Audience Insights fit into Sensor Tower’s analytics ecosystem?","answer":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"When paired with ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{"uri":"https://sensortower.com/product/digital-advertising/pathmatics"},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Pathmatics Digital Advertising Insights","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"hyperlink"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":", Audience Insights provides valuable information about the target personas reached by your competitors, giving users a deeper understanding of campaign targeting and reach. ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"}}}]}],"collection":null},{"id":null,"__typename":"Section","variant":"Collection_three-per-row_section-wrapper","styles":null,"backgroundColor":null,"contentWidth":"xl","contentDirection":null,"contentSpacing":4,"introText":null,"theme":null,"background":null,"contents":[{"id":"5OA3uqTnBfQCqituJSX826","__typename":"Collection","theme":null,"variant":"three-per-row","itemsVariant":"insight","itemsWidth":null,"itemsSpacing":5,"styles":null,"settings":null,"introText":{"id":"7Dls0iJWU9YDVjzpbgrxYm","__typename":"Text","body":{"json":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Sensor Tower ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"value":"Blog","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"heading-2"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"document"},"links":{"entries":[],"assets":[]}},"align":null,"variant":null},"itemsConnection":null,"items":[{"id":"4KS3DXu0hCNKpOWmuLZYs4","__typename":"Card","variant":"blog-standard","media":[{"title":"State of Digital Advertising 2026 - Blog","id":"6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/6VgmkYUVhRV1fDV0EnCam0/3534b66ca12e2d44aa4633185df9c021/State_of_Digital_Advertising_2026_-_Blog.webp","width":"1920","height":"1110"}}],"title":null,"subtitle":"Digital Advertising Insights • September 2026","body":{"json":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"marks":[],"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"State of Digital Advertising 2026: How AI Integration and Streaming Growth Reframe Marketing Strategies","data":{},"marks":[]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"marks":[],"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"US digital ad spend hit $200 billion between August 2025 and July 2026 as brands increasingly leveraged generative AI, ChatGPT advertising, and OTT streaming to drive performance.","data":{},"marks":[]}]}]},"links":{"entries":[],"assets":[]}},"actions":null,"link":{"id":null,"__typename":"Link","text":null,"href":"/blog/state-of-digital-advertising-2026","variant":null,"color":null,"icon":null,"addSourcePage":null},"tags":null},{"id":"6iJmtr56CoPYZPlZ5w2J4l","__typename":"Card","variant":"resource-standard","media":[{"title":"State of AI Webinar Resource Card Img","id":"1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1Da98ObEEApHTRM9rYQqPV/6be1db06ab823d6b9d82773a2d6c02c1/Resource_Page__2_.jpg","width":"1920","height":"1110"}}],"title":null,"subtitle":"AI Insights","body":{"json":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"marks":[],"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Watch the On-Demand Webinar","data":{},"marks":[]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"marks":[],"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Discover the trends shaping the AI economy, from the competitive LLM landscape and market share to emerging organic and paid marketing patterns. Learn how AI is influencing product discovery, shopping behavior, and purchase decisions and how ChatGPT Ads compare with other advertising channels.","data":{},"marks":[]}]}]},"links":{"entries":[],"assets":[]}},"actions":null,"link":{"id":null,"__typename":"Link","text":null,"href":"/webinar/ai-economy-by-the-numbers-market-share-monetization-and-what-comes-next","variant":null,"color":null,"icon":null,"addSourcePage":null},"tags":[{"id":"6iJmtr56CoPYZPlZ5w2J4l","__typename":"Link","text":"Webinar","href":"#","variant":null,"color":null,"icon":null,"addSourcePage":null}]},{"id":"yJAx7sUjUzc8ESl3gTUhQ","__typename":"Card","variant":"blog-standard","media":[{"title":"GTA BLOG Hero Image","id":"2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2Wb3QcJ4P1u9j2femmpEvN/30056628636eb9e8ff4865a9dda90411/GTA_BLOG.webp","width":"1920","height":"1110"}}],"title":null,"subtitle":"Digital Advertising Insights • August 2026","body":{"json":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"marks":[],"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The Art of The Steal: GTA VI is Coming, And This is The Game Tracker You Need to Prepare","data":{},"marks":[]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"marks":[],"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Since its release in 1997, Grand Theft Auto has become one of the most successful game franchises in history, selling more than 450M copies worldwide, putting it in rare-air with Pokémon, Mario, and Call of Duty. With Rockstar Games’ latest installment GTA VI set to release in November, our live game tracker gives you all the updated data you need across PlayStation, Xbox, and Steam.\n","data":{},"marks":[]}]}]},"links":{"entries":[],"assets":[]}},"actions":null,"link":{"id":null,"__typename":"Link","text":null,"href":"/blog/the-art-of-the-steal-gtavi-is-coming-video-game-insights-sales-tracker","variant":null,"color":null,"icon":null,"addSourcePage":null},"tags":null}],"filterOptions":null,"numberOfItems":10}],"collection":null}],"slug":"product/audiences/audience-insights","seo":{"title":{"name":"title","value":"Audience Insights | Understand User Behavior \u0026 Market Trends"},"keywords":{"name":"keywords","value":"Consumer Intelligence, Consumer Insights, audience insights, targeting consumers, consumer behaviors, survey data"},"og:image":{"name":"og:image","value":{"id":"9v93epLDlYl1ZsyNFCssk","url":"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/9v93epLDlYl1ZsyNFCssk/691cbf34f24b97c891b28d9dbd0aa426/post_image__1_.jpg","title":"Banner Image - Test"}},"canonical":{"name":"canonical","value":"https://sensortower.com/product/audiences/audience-insights"},"description":{"name":"description","value":"Sensor Tower’s powerful Audience Insights tool helps you target consumers based on their behaviors. Create detailed reports and outsmart the competition. "},"twitter:image":{"name":"twitter:image","value":{"id":"9v93epLDlYl1ZsyNFCssk","url":"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/9v93epLDlYl1ZsyNFCssk/691cbf34f24b97c891b28d9dbd0aa426/post_image__1_.jpg","title":"Banner Image - Test"}},"og:titl